{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b7bba2b2d30a29792499ce742c330a7d9b5c45523941753e6eeb4c636fa1cc77", "ja": "（歩の新曲の発売を記念して、クラブを貸し切っての\nイベントを行った。歩も観客もノリノリだったな！）", "zh": "（为了纪念步的新歌发售，我们包下了整个俱乐部举办活动。步和观众们都玩得特别尽兴啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1673531ad26fb2554b6e2ab3d109ef41e1be9a7c588bd6e5e8811c5709edd045", "ja": "ふぅ……。お疲れ、{$P$}！\nなんか今日、あっという間だったね！", "zh": "呼……辛苦了，{$P$}！今天感觉一下子就过去了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7a6409f31381c536aa40dca69331f3eb1ce854890a4ee760f2ee423f4cfa4171", "ja": "こういう場所でイベントやるのもいいね♪　ファンの\nみんなとも距離が近くて、めちゃくちゃ楽しかったよ！", "zh": "在这种地方举办活动也不错呢♪　和粉丝\n们距离很近，特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1003_p", "source_sha256": "eb6690b5d7aa902ca55804abdaca61c4af7dda40c7b03c139017890384f20275", "ja": "良かった。ここなら「DJがやりたい」っていう\n歩の希望にも合うし、ピッタリかと思って。", "zh": "太好了。这里既符合步“想当DJ”的愿望，我觉得也非常合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2042161e4d9c1b30c381e6d0368fb63f77db96524075d886023fb1e166421742", "ja": "バッチリだったよ！　ありがとーっ！", "zh": "太棒了！谢谢你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a4b40a4dacc7d575bdd49bea2d4fc4dcc7c9199f70904251856bc0dbc57b2e84", "ja": "DJも楽しかったな～！！　ま、アタシのは、\nほとんどカッコだけだったけど……へへ。", "zh": "DJ也超开心的～！！嘛，我那个\n基本上只是摆摆样子而已就是了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d2ccc742139fcfa265e421112197df04df872a38435e90b111a4055764087444", "ja": "お願いしてたDJの人が、上手くカバーして\n盛り上げてくれたからな。成功して何よりだ。", "zh": "多亏拜托的DJ顺利救场，把气氛炒热了。能成功真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0e28ac259593811b46904e5320de00ccd472559f40def61ea63b33f390631ecd", "ja": "成功か……。{$P$}から見ても、\n今日のイベントは成功だったと思う？", "zh": "成功啊……从{$P$}的角度来看，你觉得今天的活动算是成功吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1008_p", "source_sha256": "49ebdf75793195a20e72343cf7052cae5aa74255bff3fc97cc761b31c0e0a312", "ja": "もちろん。\nお客さん達が皆楽しそうで、良かったと思うよ。", "zh": "当然了。\n看到客人们都那么开心，我觉得活动办得很成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dd4ac3c872e1a610a3a85e7c6c3cb336bfd57c9a5d0e639484371a30b4331067", "ja": "ん、そっか！　えへへ。", "zh": "嗯，这样啊！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8d5c17240bb2be79229a73d82411233796e7a51cbcc382cb5e4c01853da056ca", "ja": "いつもどおりのステージもいいんだけど……今日は\n『Oli Oli DISCO』のイベントだったから。", "zh": "和平时的舞台一样虽然也不错……但今天\n是《Oli Oli DISCO》的活动嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "246a217bc8ecba1d93677451c0e520a712052d4214c159bd3660e88648eb77dd", "ja": "なんか、みんなが自由に楽しめるような？\nそんなイベントにしたかったんだよね。", "zh": "总觉得，想办一场让大家都能随心所欲享受的活动？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9ee2df49c065923f2a50d948d071d542cee5b0dc86d6419db12bd7d8deb0168d", "ja": "急に「PVみたいにDJやりたい！」なんて言い出して、\n{$P$}は大変だったと思うけど……。", "zh": "我突然说出“想跟MV里一样当DJ！”这种话，\n{$P$}肯定觉得很伤脑筋吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d024bc2a4cd08afbb14ccd554ad7e7aa40c7f0165f89f369002619531c33448b", "ja": "いや、全然。アイドルにやりたい事があるなら、\nそれを叶えるのもプロデューサーの仕事だからな。", "zh": "不，完全不会。偶像要是有想做的事，帮她实现也是制作人的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "dea8034f25b9f97f44fccf133d5de0851b1dbecc4766e2f0fb0ef1946c1a45f7", "ja": "うん……そう言うと思った！", "zh": "嗯……我就知道你会这么说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3b4a6a6e7cbccd5c8307bf0fccce1e3e08121f50ee059e770e4485bcb6b12927", "ja": "それで、{$P$}はどうだった？\n今日のイベント、楽しかった？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}呢？\n今天的活动开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1016_p", "source_sha256": "259e7472b29bf72abdd46112a452ac56ba7dce2726e1bafcd1aaa5aaf993ce37", "ja": "もちろん！　歩みたいには踊れないけど、\n自然と体がリズムを刻むくらいには楽しかったよ。", "zh": "当然了！虽然我跳得没有步那么好，\n但我也开心到身体会自然而然跟着打节拍呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d8cb1cf280ffcec59e3df9707848e64bbc5466946ff56d1f27be99c1e30e8244", "ja": "それ聞いて安心した！　{$P$}が\n楽しめなかったら、全然成功じゃないからね！", "zh": "听你这么说我就放心了！要是{$P$}没能享受其中，那就完全算不上成功啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0554_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "05ffc7b95c795cc578b8cf47c40fe8c19e6b84c43188356ff33e1708930ffea3", "ja": "安心したら、なんかお腹空いてきちゃったな～。\n{$P$}、何か食べて帰ろ！", "zh": "一放心下来，肚子好像就有点饿了呢～\n{$P$}，我们吃点什么再回去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
